  "往返约 4.8 公里、2 小时左右，她 50 分钟走到湖边；看提顿主峰最好的角度之一，那天比阴天傍晚的珍妮湖还好看。": "About 3 miles round trip and around 2 hours; she reached the lake in 50 minutes. It's one of the best angles on the main Teton peaks, and that day it looked even better than Jenny Lake did on an overcast evening.",
  "湖边步道环线约 3.5 公里、2 小时，平坦好走；她半路遇上暴风雨，出发前看好天气。": "The lakeside loop is about 2.2 miles and takes 2 hours, flat and easy. She got caught in a thunderstorm partway, so check the weather before you set out.",
