  "2022 年 5 月中下旬": "Mid- to late May 2022",
  "5 月中下旬飞科迪租车玩 6 天：东门进黄石，经黄石湖、海登谷住西黄石镇，再用两天看猛犸、诺里斯、黄石大峡谷和大棱镜、老忠实，最后南下大提顿一天。每个景点都标了必去、值得去还是可去可不去，并给了游览时长，适合第一次去、想抓精华的人；博主觉得泉看多了会审美疲劳，大提顿的雪山湖泊正好互补。": "Six days in mid- to late May, flying into Cody and renting a car: in through Yellowstone's East Entrance, past Yellowstone Lake and Hayden Valley to a night in West Yellowstone, two more days for Mammoth, Norris, the Grand Canyon of the Yellowstone, Grand Prismatic, and Old Faithful, then one day south in Grand Teton. Every stop is rated must-see, worth it, or optional, with time estimates, which makes it good for first-timers who want the highlights. The writer found that hot springs start to blur together after a while, and Grand Teton's snowy peaks and lakes make a good counterpoint.",
