  "走到瀑布脚下往返约 0.8 公里、20–30 分钟，全年都有水。": "The walk to the base of the fall is about 0.5 mile round trip and takes 20–30 minutes. There's water year-round.",
  "7–8 月会变小甚至断流，11 月才慢慢恢复，5–6 月最壮观；下瀑布环线约 1.6 公里，很轻松。": "Flow shrinks or stops entirely in July and August and only slowly returns in November; May and June are the most dramatic. The Lower Yosemite Fall loop is about 1 mile and very easy.",
  "傍晚夕阳照亮半穹顶、倒映在河里的时候最好看。": "Best in the early evening, when the setting sun lights up Half Dome and its reflection shows in the river.",
  "环线最后一站，清晨人少光线好，日落也很美。": "The last stop on the loop. Early morning is quieter with good light, and sunset is lovely too.",
  "全程往返约 11.6 公里、6–8 小时；体力一般走到哥伦比亚岩（往返约 4.8 公里、2–3 小时）就能俯瞰山谷，一路之字形上坡。": "The full hike is about 7.2 miles round trip and takes 6–8 hours. If you're of average fitness, going as far as Columbia Rock (about 3 miles round trip, 2–3 hours) still gets you a view over the valley. It's switchbacks uphill the whole way.",
  "她低估了难度，全程都是上坡；冬天部分路段关闭，只走到了替代路线上的 Clark Point 远看内华达瀑布。": "She underestimated it: it's uphill the entire way. Part of the trail was closed for winter, so she only made it to Clark Point on the alternate route, with a distant view of Nevada Fall.",
  "山谷旅馆每晚约 $200–300 多；Curry Village 加热帐篷约 $120，有淋浴但不隔音，带耳塞；Upper Pines 营地 $36，提前 5 个月开放预订，旺季 1 分钟抢光。": "Valley lodges run about $200–300+ a night. Heated tents at Curry Village are about $120, with showers but thin walls, so bring earplugs. Upper Pines Campground is $36; reservations open 5 months ahead and peak dates sell out within a minute.",
  "食物一定锁进熊柜。": "Always lock your food in a bear box.",
  "看地球上体积最大的树、沿悬崖爬莫罗岩、开国王峡谷景观道、进大理石溶洞。只打卡经典部分，2–3 天就够。": "See the largest tree on Earth by volume, climb Moro Rock along the cliff, drive the Kings Canyon Scenic Byway, and tour a marble cave. Sticking to the classics, 2–3 days is plenty.",
  "红杉（3 个必打卡）": "Sequoia (three essentials)",
