  "红杉国家公园": "Sequoia National Park",
  "近 4,000 公里的美国西南大环线全记录：死亡谷 → 拉斯维加斯 → 锡安 → 布莱斯 → 摩押（峡谷地、拱门）→ Bluff 堡和鹅颈湾 → 纪念碑谷 → 佩吉（马蹄湾、羚羊谷）→ 大峡谷，最后沿 66 号公路一直开到头。": "A full record of a nearly 2,500-mile loop through the American Southwest: Death Valley → Las Vegas → Zion → Bryce → Moab (Canyonlands, Arches) → Bluff Fort and Goosenecks → Monument Valley → Page (Horseshoe Bend, Antelope Canyon) → Grand Canyon, then all the way to the end of Route 66.",
