  "66 号公路": "Route 66",
  "3 周、5,000 多公里的美国西海岸自驾：拉斯维加斯 → 胡佛水坝 → 大峡谷 → 马蹄湾 → 优胜美地 → 旧金山（恶魔岛、金门大桥）→ 洛杉矶（太平洋海岸公路、格里菲斯天文台、圣莫尼卡、好莱坞、环球影城）→ 回拉斯维加斯。旁白是博主自己写的，配音用了 AI。": "A 3-week, 3,100-plus-mile road trip along the U.S. West Coast: Las Vegas → Hoover Dam → Grand Canyon → Horseshoe Bend → Yosemite → San Francisco (Alcatraz, Golden Gate Bridge) → Los Angeles (Pacific Coast Highway, Griffith Observatory, Santa Monica, Hollywood, Universal Studios) → back to Las Vegas. The creator wrote the narration himself; the voiceover is AI-generated.",
  "回拉斯维加斯": "Back to Las Vegas",
  "德国": "Germany",
  "环球旅行 5 年、后来移居泰国的德国夫妻 Daniel 和 Jessi，开露营车从摩押经盐湖城到黄石，从西门进园、在园里待了 4 天。这一集是第一天：营地、熊、野牛和沿途风景，下一集还有更多熊。": "Daniel and Jessi, a German couple who traveled the world for 5 years and later moved to Thailand, drive their camper van from Moab by way of Salt Lake City to Yellowstone, entering at the West Entrance and spending 4 days in the park. This episode is day 1: campground, bears, bison, and scenery along the way, with more bears in the next episode.",
